---
params: [spot: String, rows: String, problem: String, secret: String, secretFor: String]
---
<div class="backdrop">
  <section class="editor" id="editor" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Bots">
    <h2>Bots</h2>
    <p class="hint">A bot is a member like anyone else, and uses Slick through its API with a token: <code>Authorization: Bearer …</code> It belongs to <%= spot %>, where anyone can look after it, or to you, and you can bring it to your other organizations.</p>
<% if !secret.empty? %>
    <div class="secret" role="status">
      <p>The token for <strong><%= secretFor %></strong>. Copy it now: it is not shown again.</p>
      <code><%= secret %></code>
    </div>
<% end %>
    <ul class="bots"><%== rows %></ul>
    <form class="asking" data-live="bot-create" data-live-quiet>
      <input name="name" placeholder="deploy-bot" maxlength="40" autocomplete="off">
      <select name="owner" aria-label="Who the bot belongs to">
        <option value="organization">Belongs to <%= spot %></option>
        <option value="me">Belongs to me</option>
      </select>
<% if !problem.empty? %>
      <p class="problem" role="alert"><%= problem %></p>
<% end %>
      <div class="actions">
        <button type="submit" class="primary">Create a bot</button>
        <button type="button" class="quiet" data-event="cancel">Close</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </section>
</div>
